# =============================================================
# AEGIS Security Triage — Accepted Risk Register
# =============================================================
# This file lists CVEs formally analyzed and suppressed.
# Every CVE listed here must have a documented justification
# in docs/SECURITY_REPORT.md (Section 3).
# =============================================================

# Justification: DoS via memory exhaustion in brace-expansion.
# Affects global npm CLI (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm) in Node base image.
# Zero runtime risk: production container runs "node app.js" (npm CLI is never invoked).
CVE-2026-14257

# Justification: ReDoS variant on intermediate arrays in brace-expansion.
# Affects internal npm CLI tooling only. Zero runtime exposure.
CVE-2026-69152

# Justification: Inconsistent IP parsing (potential SSRF) in ip-address.
# Internal npm CLI dependency. App code uses Express + pg without invoking ip-address.
CVE-2026-69192
